IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROGRAM-D.
* Account reconciliation program.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ACCOUNT-ID PIC X(12).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC SQL
      UPDATE ACCOUNT_TABLE SET LAST_REVIEW_DATE = CURRENT DATE
       WHERE ACCOUNT_ID = :WS-ACCOUNT-ID
    END-EXEC.
    COPY ACCOUNT-RECORD.
    STOP RUN.
